; Handler of the word "print": switch the ZX printer on
;
; Sets PrinterFlag to 1 when a printer answers on port $FB (bit 6 clear). An
; open bus reads $FF, so with no printer the flag stays as it was. Then goes
; on with the next word. The word "noprint" is #R$82AF.
; .
; Hardware: reads the ZX printer port $FB.
@label=WordPrint
@isub=IN A,(PORT_PRINTER)
c$82A5 IN A,($FB)
 $82A7 BIT 6,A          ; the ROM tests this bit for "no printer" too
 $82A9 JR NZ,$82B3
 $82AB LD A,$01         ; A=1 stored by the code at #R$82AF+1
 $82AD JR $82B0         ; into PrinterFlag
